#### VOTE - Return your ballot by mail, at an Official Ballot Drop Box, or vote in-person at a Vote Center or at the Registrar of Voters' Office.

[Click here to find your nearest Vote Center](https://vote.santaclaracounty.gov/vote-person/find-vote-center "Find a Vote Center")

[Click here to find your nearest Official Drop Box](https://vote.santaclaracounty.gov/vote-mail/find-ballot-drop-box-locations "Find Ballot Drop Box Locations")

